Q: What is the best course of action when you find yourself spontaneously
   turned into a warg?

Q: What is likely to be the underlying cause of turning into a warg? (not due
   to a wand/trap etc, - just out of the blue).

I have an excellent Barbarian who is holed up with only 32 hitpoints (max)
desperately trying unicorn horns, holy water, potions of extra healing, even
garlic, all to no avail. When I prayed it just said `whatitsname is happy
with you' or similar - my warginess is non-diminished.

I went to see the oracle for advice - he just took my 1000gp and did 
absolutely nothing (as far as I am concerned the oracle is useless). I quaffed
at a fountain until I was enlightened, it told me I was stridently aligned,
and went through this huge list of neat attributes, the only negative seems
to be that I `aggravate monsters', which I think I aquired by feeding this
poor kitten that accosted me instead of pulverising it with one blow (it
seems slightly weird that killing a hostile kitten is safer than feeding it
and letting it go its own way - non?). 

Am I perhaps a werewolf? I had an encounter with one several levels back, 
and it did manage to bite me once or twice, although there were no extra
messages such as I would have expected had it infected me with lycanthropy.
I immediately applied a unicorn horn just to be sure in any case.

I need advice. I have so far located absolutely no altars (zero, zilch, nada)
in this dungeon, so sacrificing like crazy is not an easy thing to do.
Going looking for an altar in my present condition at level sixteen in
the dungeon would be an extremely risky venture - there are a whole bunch of
nasties at that level who could polish me off with a single blow - and I 
know that there are no altars earlier on.

I have faith that nethack is not a totally capricious game - there ought to
be some way of getting out of this situation - suggestions would be greatly
appreciated. I am using vs 3.0i patchlevel 7 .

While I am asking questions, how do you aquire the ability to teleport at will.
I have had both teleport and teleport control for ages, but show no signs of
developing this ability.

